-- Second batch of find / verify / cities results (PRs #390-#417, 2026-11-05 to 11-08).
-- Promoted on their own pages: Mahj Mixers (Baltimore), the two City of San Diego recreation-center groups, Mahj On My Mind (Marin), MS Mahj's Memphis Chess Club lessons, Missy Mahjong (Nashville), Maj by Daron (Scottsdale; also ACTIVE under Phoenix).
-- Duplicates retired: Lisa / Blue Tiger Mahj Club under Batavia (already ACTIVE under Geneva and Glen Ellyn), the second Stroum JCC row in Seattle (eight Free Play sessions are added to the ACTIVE row).
-- New unpublished cities: Scarsdale (library open play, "NMJL 2026 card and rules"), Southampton (Arts Center workshop), Portland ME (JCA, Cape Elizabeth Community Services, Judi Slotsky), Rochester (JCC, two instructors; the JCC is in Brighton), St. Petersburg (Master Your Mahjong).
-- Indianapolis: five Zionsville lessons (play.meetatmahj.com) go under the ACTIVE Jaime Keith / Meet at Mahj; the server found no American wording on the studio pages, the owner's own site is what makes the row ACTIVE.
-- Held: Bend (private-home venues, promote-skip), Liberty (promote-skip), Canyon Ranch retreat (resort stay), Troy (member venue), Johnson County KS, Fox Point (JCC Milwaukee = Samson JCC, MKE Mahjong already listed), Hartford sessions (River Bend Bookshop already has them under West Hartford), Memphis sessions that repeat the Olive Branch ones.
